    "details": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"254\">As part of <strong data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"73\">Parinaam 2026 at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham</strong>, HACKOPOLY is a 24-hour competitive hackathon that brings together student innovators, developers, and technology enthusiasts to build impactful solutions to real-world challenges.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"628\">Participants can compete across four domains: <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"397\">AI/ML, Quantum Computing, IoT &amp; Smart Infrastructure, and Web3 &amp; Decentralized Technologies</strong>. Each domain offers an <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"440\">Open Innovation</strong> option, allowing teams to identify a problem of their choice and develop an innovative technology-driven solution. <strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"628\">IoT &amp; Smart Infrastructure is exclusively an Open Innovation domain.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"860\">The hackathon features a <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"763\">24-hour build sprint, multiple technical reviews, a live leaderboard, and a Team-to-Team Night Challenge</strong>, creating a competitive environment that evaluates both innovation and technical implementation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"1018\">For teams developing hardware-based prototypes, <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1017\">participants are required to carry their own components and hardware required for prototype development</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1173\">With a <strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1060\">total prize pool of ₹1,00,000</strong>, HACKOPOLY provides an opportunity to showcase technical expertise, creativity, problem-solving, and innovation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1390\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"68\">Entry Fee:</strong> Selected teams will be required to pay an <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"143\" data-is-only-node=\"\">entry fee of ₹2,000 per team</strong>. This fee includes access to the <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"203\">Auto Expo and DJ Night</strong>, which will be held on campus during the same dates as the hackathon.</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1625\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\n<li data-section-id=\"sxy2ia\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1422\"><strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1403\">Date:</strong> 11&ndash;12 October 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19z01sd\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1480\"><strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1435\">Venue:</strong> Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Amaravati Campus</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16h5pvh\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1509\"><strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1497\">Team Size:</strong> 3&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15i3ezx\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1558\"><strong data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1528\">Eligibility:</strong> Tech and Engineering Students</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pzhlw5\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1625\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1573\">Domains:</strong> AI/ML | Quantum | IoT &amp; Smart Infrastructure | Web3</li>\n</ul>",
